{"4606060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MADD: Mine Asteroids, Don't Die", "steam_appid": 4606060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using <strong>thrust-based physics-controls</strong> in the frictionless void of space, accelerate in 4 directions without ever turning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/extras/e0ee709902c0aa7460837f22d8d0fe44.poster.avif?t=1781221378\" width=710 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/extras/e0ee709902c0aa7460837f22d8d0fe44.webm?t=1781221378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/extras/e0ee709902c0aa7460837f22d8d0fe44.mp4?t=1781221378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>gameplay-changing equipment</strong> while mining as much ore as possible, which you use to upgrade your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay in one zone, the more threats you attract. Get back to <strong>your hauler</strong> to repair damage and upgrade, and blast off to the next zone when things get too dangerous for you to handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/extras/7ce8e27e0ffc19d63437ea05861bffb0.poster.avif?t=1781221378\" width=710 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/extras/7ce8e27e0ffc19d63437ea05861bffb0.webm?t=1781221378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/extras/7ce8e27e0ffc19d63437ea05861bffb0.mp4?t=1781221378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique bullet-hell with tough controls, &quot;<strong>Mine Asteroids, Don't Die</strong>&quot; is meant to feel like a classic arcade game that was never made, but with a strangely realistic aesthetic, in a &quot;space-horror&quot; setting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an <strong>early work-in-progress preview</strong> - more info such as the <strong>full reveal</strong> is <strong>coming soon</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Wishlist</strong> or follow to get notified of the coming <strong>playtest</strong>, <strong>demo</strong>, or release.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using <strong>thrust-based physics-controls</strong> in the frictionless void of space, accelerate in 4 directions without ever turning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/extras/e0ee709902c0aa7460837f22d8d0fe44.poster.avif?t=1781221378\" width=710 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/extras/e0ee709902c0aa7460837f22d8d0fe44.webm?t=1781221378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/extras/e0ee709902c0aa7460837f22d8d0fe44.mp4?t=1781221378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>gameplay-changing equipment</strong> while mining as much ore as possible, which you use to upgrade your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay in one zone, the more threats you attract. Get back to <strong>your hauler</strong> to repair damage and upgrade, and blast off to the next zone when things get too dangerous for you to handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/extras/7ce8e27e0ffc19d63437ea05861bffb0.poster.avif?t=1781221378\" width=710 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/extras/7ce8e27e0ffc19d63437ea05861bffb0.webm?t=1781221378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/extras/7ce8e27e0ffc19d63437ea05861bffb0.mp4?t=1781221378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique bullet-hell with tough controls, &quot;<strong>Mine Asteroids, Don't Die</strong>&quot; is meant to feel like a classic arcade game that was never made, but with a strangely realistic aesthetic, in a &quot;space-horror&quot; setting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an <strong>early work-in-progress preview</strong> - more info such as the <strong>full reveal</strong> is <strong>coming soon</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Wishlist</strong> or follow to get notified of the coming <strong>playtest</strong>, <strong>demo</strong>, or release.</p>", "short_description": "&quot;Space-horror bullet-hell&quot;, with thrust and momentum-based controls. Pilot a small mining &amp; salvaging vessel through asteroids, starship wrecks, and hostile entities in the dark void of space. Find unique equipment for your ship, and return to your hauler to upgrade and repair. Don't die.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Hindi, Kazakh, Khmer, Persian, Serbian, Malay", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/6c12e523f47fa250abb560a33c4bffcfafa4fdf5/header.jpg?t=1781221378", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/87b05b966f4950247af8d67758a30076964f9d7a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781221378", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/87b05b966f4950247af8d67758a30076964f9d7a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781221378", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Helmi Bastami (Flyborg.net)"], "publishers": ["Helmi Bastami (Flyborg.net)"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/ec5c1626eea9ab076c98dfe3b90cdef4003d7709/ss_ec5c1626eea9ab076c98dfe3b90cdef4003d7709.600x338.jpg?t=1781221378", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/ec5c1626eea9ab076c98dfe3b90cdef4003d7709/ss_ec5c1626eea9ab076c98dfe3b90cdef4003d7709.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781221378"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606060/ec46da8da4a9197f952ebde973cc0e88649a7f7b/ss_ec46da8da4a9197f952ebde973cc0e88649a7f7b.600x338.jpg?t=1781221378", "path_full": "ht